his patch focuses entirely on resolving the major visual and performance bugs you have been reporting over the past few days.\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f: Bug Fixes & Performance Upgrades*\n\n\n*OpenXR Screen Tearing:* Completely resolved the OpenXR glitch causing severe screen tearing during gameplay.\n*Black Box Glitch:* Fixed the recurring issue where a solid \"black box\" would obstruct your display.\n*Rendering Artifacts:* Eliminated the vertical stripes and related rendering bugs.\n*Frame Budget Optimization:* Stabilized the overall frame rate for a significantly smoother VR experience.", "created_date": 1788437971, "id": "28128855153440449", "version": "6.6.8", "version_code": 310, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "28128849836774314"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}